# Composable Text — a pill button whose label morphs "Use Max" <-> "Using Max"
# per character: new letters spring in (custom entering: opacity + scale),
# removed ones fade out, the rest slide with springified LinearTransitions,
# the pill resizes with its own layout spring and the colour times 1 <-> 0.5.
# What this test covers: toggling to "Using Max" and back with full settles;
# toggling again before the layout springs settle (entering/exiting
# letters interrupted); a burst of rapid taps so characters enter and exit
# while previous layout animations are still running; ending on "Use Max".
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/composable-text"
wait "label=\"U s e   M a x\"" 10000
wait 1500
press "label=\"U s e   M a x\""
wait "label=\"U s i n g   M a x\"" 3000
wait 1000
press "label=\"U s i n g   M a x\""
wait "label=\"U s e   M a x\"" 3000
wait 1000
# Toggle before the springs settle.
press 201 437
wait 150
press 201 437
wait 150
press 201 437
wait 1500
press 201 437
wait 1500
# Rapid burst (even count ends where it started).
press 201 437 --count 8 --interval-ms 70
wait 2000
wait "label=\"U s e   M a x\"" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
